      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLAME KARISSA (4) fast away and ran her rivals ragged to score by a space two back then hit the frame last time when third at this track (22.61) latest. Leading chance again. CLAUSE EDWARD (7) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 3 length fifth (24.75) over 425m at Bendigo. Expected to feature in the finish. PAW MINTY (6) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at Traralgon. Expected to do much better this time. PRETTY PANAMA (2) is not to be discarded.",
